# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the Mix page over the progression page's chord at Thickness 80 with
# the arp on: as the sound has it, then the drones -12 dB, the pad off, the arp +6 dB, and back to 0 one by one.
# Not a test of its own.
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
tap HOME
set 87 80
tap ARP
wait 600
tapkey 0
wait 2000
kpage 4
wav mix.wav
wait 2000
turn K1 -12
wait 2000
turn K2 -40
wait 2000
shot mix-page.png
turn K4 6
wait 2000
turn K1 12
turn K2 31
turn K4 -6
wait 2000
wavstop
